  "id": "cider-braised-pork-shoulder",
  "name": "Cider-Braised Pork Shoulder",
  "subtitle": "Tender pork in a savory apple-cider sauce",
  "description": "Browned pork shoulder is braised with onion, sage, hard cider, and vinegar, then finished with a creamy, lightly spiced sauce.",
  "meal_type": "main",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "yield": {
